<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it had cut its rating for Banco Santander-Chile to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Peter Howe wrote in a Jan 29 report that he changed his recommendation because of the company's &quot;strong relative outperformance since our buy recommendation on 1 October 1996 of 28.7 percent and given that it has met our 12-month price target of $16.8.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed down 1/8 to 16-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
